WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,800
Try the old Beijing Erbangjiang that my uncle bought from the town today. There are twelve packs in total.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
We don’t smoke anyway

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,850
Come and get the tiger zit anytime you want.

4
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:18,650
I heard from my second uncle that you shot the rabbit.

5
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:21,450
It’s okay to kill a wild boar, third brother.

6
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:22,450
I'm just lucky

7
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:27,440
According to my father's level, it's almost three times flat.

8
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,040
It’s not that the second uncle talks too much

9
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,040
Now Huzi has found a career

10
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:32,440
At least he's doing his job

11
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:34,730
Should you also find a parent to work with?

12
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:39,500
Don't lie on your bed all day

13
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:45,940
How can I marry a wife like this? Why did my second uncle marry a wife?

14
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:49,020
My eldest brother and second brother have both inherited the family lineage of Lao Ma.

15
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:51,020
And your tiger son is just as good as me.

16
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:53,620
Right now my father and I’s combined salary is less than 100 yuan a month.

17
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:54,820
Just four months of work a year

18
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:56,220
In addition to firewood, rice, oil and salt

19
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,620
It can be said that there is no cost of living

20
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:59,820
Even if we eat hotpot mutton every meal, it’s enough for the two of us.

21
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:00,820
Life is comfortable

22
00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:03,620
Leaders in other cities can stay in bed for a year

23
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:05,420
I have to brave the cold wind for three to nine days

24
00:01:05,420 --> 00:01:06,420
It's been four months since I chopped wood.

25
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:11,900
I've only been lying down for eight months. Brother, you don't care.

26
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:16,780
There is some truth to what Sanping said. Sanping?

27
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:20,180
You can't just watch the thief being beaten and not see the thief eating meat, you grown man

28
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:21,580
There's not even a woman at home

29
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:22,980
Just a warm bed

30
00:01:23,380 --> 00:01:26,060
It’s worth it to expose yourself a little bit, Uncle Er.

31
00:01:26,260 --> 00:01:28,460
Who said I don't have anyone to warm my bed? Don't say anything about me.

32
00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:31,460
Even my dad has an old widow watching him every day. God, don’t fart.

33
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:34,020
Huzi isn’t married yet, so don’t be too bad.

34
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:37,140
Tiger cubs grow every three days

35
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:38,740
Make some noise for that girl named Lin Xia

36
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:40,140
I don't believe she didn't do anything

37
00:01:40,340 --> 00:02:08,550
It’s been too long since I’ve eaten mutton

38
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:10,300
She never got it under control

39
00:02:10,930 --> 00:02:12,130
What a disaster you are

40
00:02:12,330 --> 00:02:18,820
A few days ago, I cut some mutton for convenience.

41
00:02:18,820 --> 00:02:20,220
My husband and I bought another refrigerator.

42
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:21,420
One hundred liter snowflake tray

43
00:02:21,420 --> 00:02:22,620
Only six hundred and thirty-five yuan

44
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,680
The largest appliance in our home

45
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,280
It seems to be a radio, right?

46
00:02:31,220 --> 00:02:32,220
Look at my third brother

47
00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:33,820
Decades ahead of thought

48
00:02:34,220 --> 00:02:35,820
This is the person who truly understands life
